      "line": 212,
      "statement_lean": "theorem classification (r s : \u2115) (hr : 1 \u2264 r) (hs : 1 \u2264 s) :\n    PathExists r s \u2194\n      ((r : \u2124) \u2223 (s : \u2124) - 1 \u2228 (r : \u2124) \u2223 (s : \u2124) + 1 \u2228 |(r : \u2124) - 3 * (s : \u2124)| = 1)",
      "scope": "Closed classification for r,s >= 1: integer r divides s-1 or s+1, or abs(r-3*s)=1; literal-path eventual periodicity for all natural positive starts and nonnegative slopes, including parameter-one boundaries and constant rays. Explicit quotient-model definitions retained.",
